    <inlineHelpText>How to compare the field value with the Text or Date Value. For Text and Picklist fields (not case-sensitive): Contains, Equals, Does Not Equal, Starts With. For Date and Date/Time fields, using a relative date (e.g. THIS MONTH) or fixed date (YYYY-MM-DD): Equals (in range), Does Not Equal (outside range), Before Start (before first day), After Start (first day or later), Before End (last day or earlier), After End (after last day). Leave blank for numeric ranges.</inlineHelpText>
